            <ArticleTitle>Triptans: do they differ?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>133-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Headache care specialists agree that the introduction of sumatriptan constitutes a major advance in headache therapy, but they differ about whether other triptans offer clinically significant advantages over sumatriptan. This article examines this issue by considering the similarities and differences among triptans.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
